# This recipe requires only the standalone Runner sources. Never send env,
# credentials, Git history, dependencies, media or old runtime packs to a builder.
**
!apps/
!apps/runner-app/
!apps/runner-app/Cargo.toml
!apps/runner-app/Cargo.lock
!apps/runner-app/src/
!apps/runner-app/src/**
!apps/runner-app/MediaProbe.Containerfile
